      "content": "i'm just really scared to go to the hospital right now, the wait times are insane and i don't have much money for an ER visit if it's nothing. is there any way i can just take some extra ibuprofen or maybe an aspirin to see if the pain goes away first? if it's just inflammation or something i could probably just sleep it off.",
